Package: cnvs
Title: An HTML Canvas Graphics Device
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A custom R graphics device, written for learning purposes, that
    renders base/grid graphics as JavaScript 'CanvasRenderingContext2D' calls
    embedded in a standalone HTML file. The point of the package is not to be
    a polished plotting backend (see the 'canvas' package on CRAN, or
    'webr::canvas()', for that) but to be a small, heavily commented
    implementation that is easy to read alongside R's graphics device API
    documentation (see 'R_ext/GraphicsDevice.h' and 'R_ext/GraphicsEngine.h'
    in the R sources).
